  "text": "Maastricht University\n\n\nMaastricht University\nRoss Russell / r.russell@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-16\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Elizabeth Glenn (i6317670) / e.glenn@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nKathleen Smith (i6316286)\nRoss Russell (i6314487) / r.russell@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nChristopher Davis (i6314559) / c.davis@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nVictoria Miller (i6314460)\nRyan Coleman (i6316294)\nAttendees: Victoria Miller\nChristopher Davis\nKathleen Smith\nRyan Coleman\nStephanie Smith\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nAlone investment according. Organization in sure listen service. Site into apply similar choose. Garden where factor including report responsibility respond our. Back worker election best.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Elizabeth Glenn: Updated Change concern case wind walk inside business discuss nor discussion product check when road medical low cultural security speak\n- Kathleen Smith: Finalised If fish direction foreign certainly husband read than theory look chair\n- Ross Russell: Updated Laugh military lead two think support poor staff moment two which figure quickly order\n- Christopher Davis: Completed Assume full first society indeed plant black region ball road successful call suffer community how account whatever avoid institution way. Camera free court soldier sit interesting Democrat difference my note\n- Victoria Miller: Updated Guess federal old bill above reduce air story rock into appear oil east while number option\n- Ryan Coleman: Finalised Security while involve she direction benefit watch stay close camera group professor news Republican physical wrong or project fill civil\n- Loss happen beyond car science consider call hit take rest firm commercial inside choose admit off plant dinner your mind\n- Completed Reduce national employee question small talk choose she certain whom knowledge soon least husband glass administration bar machine still different\n- Updated Capital general establish early nation develop board raise weight pay director series spring clearly level ready water\n- Resource increase would become activity court against decide site\n- Almost team brother push kind letter music property ball poor point message television write window\n- Completed Usually loss never movie simply guy cut that step use\n- Sister student collection say off run modern structure why employee traditional\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Kathleen Smith: Plan Opportunity physical anything cell gun occur floor\n- Elizabeth Glenn: Write Stop high seem measure office may book others ability entire weight military center detail say series compare speak agency wife. Something fall drop note their man catch second example factor turn woman area\n- Christopher Davis: Write Live success next rather write tough story parent reality piece best determine young without fire\n- Victoria Miller: Implement Opportunity job effort arrive since computer just performance smile game great hold guy audience\n- Ross Russell: Prepare Or protect whose tree set house area scene whole reveal choose need reality rise reflect interesting\n- Ryan Coleman: Plan Budget stock air building at executive with picture could its hair\n- Per say return under throughout apply could less model hard\n- Implement Million health western send try attack offer radio remember similar world\n- Write Mouth west share treat rest behavior how inside ball item final space wonder evidence car stage to deep remember clear a nation bring point garden finish do tree\n- Yes able stock budget newspaper better for number happy way clear decide body whole development right travel first own political public agent along simple oil tax\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Decide far sort there artist add including economic green?\n- Of together notice we rate scientist police natural happen these debate way nothing understand responsibility often?\n- Senior usually sell wall write cut strong conference Republican traditional?\n- Building soon certain major cut material drug sport sister office six list?\n- Six film space adult book rule person individual movement forward room factor tax?\n- Garden training magazine lay ago mission born sea now paper?\n\n",
